  "guid": "com.dagrog.dagrogsplusp",
  "name": "DaGrogsPlusP",
  "slug": "dagrogsplusp",
  "teaser": "\"Was it 15 grains of unique or 50?\"",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/ADNjoc8Sjx43SFaNfvPPzmgCbLf65Z65A0VImIlB.jpg",
  "downloads": 1555,
  "favourites_count": 3,
  "description": "<p>A follow up to my subsonic mod, this mod allows for truly end game performance in smaller calibers and also introduces a hypersonic 9x39 cartridge. This ammo is OP, so I tried to balance it with high recoil stats, high wear and heat stats, and high price locked behind level 3/4 traders. Please keep in mind this was made so I can LARP with a base makarov in labs and actually manage to down PMCs semi-reliably with APBS Bots with class 5 and 6 plates/helmets alongside my own buffed armor system (which is NOT in this mod), so yes I know the ammo is not exactly the most balanced but now you too can LARP with a PB like you’re secret agent in Tarkov, and not instantly die. What IS in this mod so far is:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>9x18 “Konchik Igly”, Level 3 Prapor</li>\n<li>9x19 Over Pressure AP, Level 4 Mechanic</li>\n<li>9x21 Model 6, Level 4 Peacekeeper</li>\n<li>9x39 Mechanic Special, Level 4 Mechanic</li>\n<li>45 ACP Hyper Pen, Level 3 Peacekeeper</li>\n<li>50 AE Anti Armored Asset, Level 4 Peacekeeper</li>\n<li>57x28 Project S, Level 4 Peacekeeper</li>\n<li>357 Mag Maximum, Level 4 Skier</li>\n<li>762x25TT AP Flat Nose, Level 3 Prapor</li>\n<li>12/70 Anti-Material Slug, Level 4 Skier</li>\n<li>20/70 Anti-Material Slug, Level 4 Prapor</li>\n<li>12.7x55mm PS12Ax, Level 4 Prapor</li>\n</ul>\n<p>As far as I saw, no bots have used the ammo against me in gameplay testing.</p>\n<p>Most Recent WTT Common Lib required for the mod to work - Also, has no manifest. Do not know what that is, doesn’t affect my gameplay beyond some scary server text. Download at your own risk, I tested it and it works for me but as I say this mod is optional.</p>\n",
